# Secure-backend identity-v2 physically accepted the exact two standard
# listeners, then stopped fail-closed at qsee-app-loader's combined acquire
# boundary. errno 22 does not distinguish its initial unprivileged attach from
# the privileged load fallback, and the kernel emitted no app-load rejection,
# so focal64 secure-world acceptance remains unknown rather than rejected.
