# Identity-v3 proved that focal64.mdt is ELF64/AArch64 and reaches the
# privileged QSEECOM load boundary, where the carried ELF32-only MDT assembly
# helper rejects it with EINVAL before qcom_scm app-start. Patch 0043 adds a
# separate bounds-checked, little-endian AArch64 path only to the contiguous
# image helpers; the remoteproc ELF32 loader remains unchanged.
FP6_FINGERPRINT_MDT_ELF64_PATCH_SHA256=fb78f90048bb699f2225b319a2fd6296f5696d9a828ee42f9b35945ab2cc9331
